/target
lcov.info
.chock/last-run.json
.chock/run.lock
.chock/mutest-kills.json
kani-list.json
# `?*.chock` and not `*.chock`: `*` matches the empty string, so that pattern hides all of `.chock/`,
# config and agents.md included, and a clone then runs no gates at all.
?*.chock
?*.chock.[0-9]*
.*.tmp
.chock/verdicts.json
.chock/last-edit
rustc-ice-*.txt
